  "decision": "Conditional approval for exploratory main-complex conventional gas fit, retaining every source-valid pixel. No proof of blend-free full-system coverage or precision-calibration suitability.",
  "recommendations": [
    "Retain FeII1611 as an unsaturated saturation constraint, with explicit sky-feature uncertainty and a with/without1611 sensitivity comparison.",
    "Freeze window and source-valid mask before fits; no fitted-residual clipping.",
    "Describe the selected main complex rather than an isolated complete absorber. Blue boundary is a local near-continuum separation with limited clean margin; assess boundary sensitivity if conclusions depend on offsets.",
    "Record nearby features outside the window without asserting their identity or excluding them as proven blends.",
    "Treat 2382 deep saturation and 1608/2374 low-flux portions through shared nonlinear opacity; do not infer frequencies from their black cores alone.",
    "Do not turn relative-shift improvement into alpha or cosmic-time-law evidence."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Catalogue z_abs is rounded and supplies a coordinate origin only.",
    "Broad atmospheric band tests are proxies; no exposure-specific sky/telluric subtraction or wavelength-calibration certification.",
    "Adjacent pixel covariance and uncertainty in continuum/LSF remain outside this selection audit.",
    "FeII1611 outside-window absorption near \u2212170 and +135 km/s, and 2382 near \u2212160 km/s, have not been identified."
  ],
